## Customize Your 4-Frame Tower Setup

Outstanding choice! You've selected our maximum-yield 4-Frame Tower, designed for avid growers with a slim footprint of 0.5m² and height of 2m — enabling full ecosystems and impressive yields of ~10-20kg/year across four stackable units. 

To get started with customisation, let's configure the each of the frames in turn.

